version: 2
product: billing
code:
  units:
    role: documents
passes:
  - name: docs
    kind: guides
    template: user-guide
    target: docs/guides
    triggers: [push, pr]
  - name: release-notes
    kind: changelog
    target: docs/guides
    triggers: [release]
    options:
      changelogFile: NEWS.md
      source: changelog-file
  - name: memory
    kind: nucleus
    template: nucleus-facts
    triggers: [push]
---
mapped version: version: 2
mapped site: prefix of every pass target (docs/...)
mapped product.slug: product: billing
mapped product.role: code.units.role: documents
mapped spaces.default: guides pass docs (user-guide) -> docs/guides
dropped documents[].as: only the first as: release document (NEWS.md) becomes the changelog file; OTHER.md is dropped
mapped documents: only as: release documents, which feed the changelog pass (see documents[].as)
mapped documents[].as: changelog pass release-notes -> docs/guides reading NEWS.md
dropped knowledge.namespace: nucleus pass memory writes to the product namespace product:billing; "legacy-ns" is not inside it
